oads/2026/11/MO-PAS-Feature-Image-2026-768x403.webp 768w" /></a></div></div><div class="post-entry-content"><h3 class="ele-entry-title"><a href="https://www.ncmissouri.edu/ag-students-participate-in-state-conference/" rel="bookmark" title="Agriculture Students Participate in State Conference">Agriculture Students Participate in State Conference</a></h3><div class="entry-meta"><span class="meta-item data-link"><time class="entry-date updated" datetime="2026-11-18T09:09:58-06:00">November 18, 2026</time></span></div><div class="entry-excerpt"><p>Fifteen agriculture students from North Central Missouri College participated in the Missouri Professional Agriculture Student Organization (PAS) State Conference November&hellip;</p></div><a href="https://www.ncmissouri.edu/ag-students-participate-in-state-conference/" target="" aria-label="Read more about Agriculture Students Participate in State Conference" class="box-button elementor-button elementor-size-xs">Read more</a></div></article></div><div class="visible wf-cell" data-post-id="18032" data-date="2026-11-16T09:08:28-06:00" data-name="Closed for Thanksgiving"><article class="post visible post-18032 type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-ncmc-blog tag-1090 tag-november" data-name="Closed for Thanksgiving" data-date="2026-11-16T09:08:28-06:00"><div class="post-thumbnail-wrap"><div class="post-thumbnail"> <a class="post-thumbnail-rollover layzr-bg img-css-resize-wrapper" aria-label="Post image" href="https://www.ncmissouri.edu/closed-for-thanksgiving-3/"><img width="1200" height="630" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D&#039;http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg&#039;%20viewBox%3D&#039;0%200%201200%20630&#039;%2F%3E" class="attachment-full size-full preload-me aspect lazy lazy-load" alt="Closing for break" decoding="async" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" style="--ratio: 1200 / 630;" data-src="https://www.ncmissouri.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Closing-for-break-Feature-Image-2026.webp" loading="eager" data-srcset="https://www.ncmissouri.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Closing-for-break-Feature-Image-2026.webp 1200w, https://www.ncmissouri.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Closing-for-break-Feature-Image-2026-600x315.webp 600w, https://www.ncmissouri.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Closing-for-break-Feature-Image-2026-150x79.webp 150w, https://www.ncmissouri.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Closing-for-break-Feature-Image-2026-768x403.webp 768w" /></a></div></div><div class="post-entry-content"><h3 class="ele-entry-title"><a href="https://www.ncmissouri.edu/closed-for-thanksgiving-3/" rel="bookmark" title="Closed for Thanksgiving">Closed for Thanksgiving</a></h3><div class="entry-meta"><span class="meta-item data-link"><time class="entry-date updated" datetime="2026-11-16T09:08:28-06:00">November 16, 2026</time></span></div><div class="entry-excerpt"><p>All North Central Missouri College campuses will be closed Wednesday, November 25-Friday, November 27, in observance of the Thanksgiving holiday.&hellip;</p></div><a href="https://www.ncmissouri.edu/closed-for-thanksgiving-3/" target="" aria-label="Read more about Closed for Thanksgiving" class="box-button elementor-button elementor-size-xs">Read more</a></div></article></div><div class="visible wf-cell" data-post-id="18027" data-date="2026-11-13T09:35:48-06:00" data-name="Students Inducted into Phi Theta Kappa Honor Society"><article class="post visible post-18027 type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-ncmc-blog tag-1090 tag-november" data-name="Students Inducted into Phi Theta Kappa Honor Society" data-date="2026-11-13T09:35:48-06:00"><div class="post-thumbnail-wrap"><div class="post-thumbnail"> <a class="post-thumbnail-rollover layzr-bg img-css-resize-wrapper" aria-label="Post image" href="https://www.ncmissouri.edu/phi-theta-kappa-honor-society/"><img width="1200" height="630" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D&#039;http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org