⁠
We&#039;re celebrating International Education Week (November 16–20) on this episode by highlighting some of the international students who make NCMC&#039;s campus community so unique! 🌎🏴‍☠️⁠
⁠
In Episode 12, host Nicole Shell sits down with Jamie Cunningham, NCMC&#039;s International Student Representative, and international students Riky Staurenghi, Alejandro Somaza Silva, and Melaku Simon.⁠
⁠
Hear about their journeys to NCMC, adjusting to life in Missouri, balancing academics and athletics, and the friendships and experiences that have made NCMC feel like home. Jamie also shares stories from her international recruitment travels and how she helps students navigate their college experience.⁠
⁠
From cultural differences and Missouri weather to favorite foods and future goals, this episode celebrates the diverse backgrounds and perspectives our international students bring to the Pirate community!⁠
⁠
🎧 Tune in to Episode 12 of Pirate Perspectives: https://www.buzzsprout.com/admin/2536323/episodes/20129028-pirate-perspectives-episode-12-international-students ⁠
⁠
You can also find Pirate Perspectives on Apple Podcasts and Spotify—just search Pirate Perspectives and hit Follow so you never miss an episode! 🎧⁠
⁠
Whether you&#039;re from just down the road or halfway around the world, we&#039;re glad you&#039;re part of the Pirate family! ❤️🖤⁠
⁠
