⁠
All North Central Missouri College campuses will be closed Wednesday, November 25-Friday, November 27, in observance of the Thanksgiving holiday. No on-ground classes will be held, and all offices will be closed. North Central Missouri College will reopen on Monday, November 30, for regular business hours.  For more information about NCMC holiday hours, contact 660-359-3948.⁠
⁠
The Ketcham Community Center hours on Wednesday, November 25, will be 6:00 a.m. until 6:00 p.m. and will be closed on Thursday, November 27, and Friday, November 27 6:00 a.m.-12:00 p.m. On Saturday, November 28, and Sunday, November 29, KCC will be open during regular hours.  For more information about the Ketcham Community Center, contact 660-359-3948 x1450. ⁠" aria-hidden="true"><noscript><img decoding="async" src="https://www.ncmissouri.edu/wp-content/plugins/instagram-feed/img/placeholder.png" alt="North Central Missouri College and Ketcham Center Closed for Thanksgiving⁠
⁠
