⁠
November 16–20 is International Education Week, and NCMC is proud to celebrate the diverse cultures, experiences, and perspectives that our international students bring to campus!⁠
⁠
Did you know NCMC currently has students enrolled from 9 different countries? 🇨🇴 🇻🇪 🇩🇴 🇹🇴 🇬🇧 🇮🇹 🇨🇼 🇲🇽 🇪🇸⁠
⁠
Our international students represent Colombia, Venezuela, the Dominican Republic, Tonga, England, Italy, Curaçao, Mexico, and Spain!⁠
⁠
These students enrich our campus community by sharing their unique backgrounds, traditions, and experiences while pursuing their educational goals at NCMC.⁠
⁠
🎙️ Be sure to check back tomorrow for a new episode of Pirate Perspectives! This month&#039;s episode features NCMC&#039;s International Student Representative and three of our international students as they share their experiences studying in the United States and being part of the NCMC community.⁠
⁠
Join us in celebrating the connections, friendships, and opportunities that international education brings to NCMC! ❤️🖤⁠
⁠
