⁠
Congratulations to three outstanding NCMC students who were recently inducted into the Phi Theta Kappa (PTK) Honor Society during a special ceremony at our Savannah Campus on November 10!⁠
⁠
👏 Please join us in celebrating our newest PTK members:⁠
⁠
⭐ Jenna Gray – Cameron, MO⁠
⁠
⭐ Mariana Pablo – St. Joseph, MO⁠
⁠
⭐ Izabella Walker – Skidmore, MO⁠
⁠
Phi Theta Kappa recognizes academic excellence among two-year college students and provides opportunities for scholarships, leadership development, and community service. Students must achieve a GPA of 3.50 or higher and meet additional eligibility requirements to receive an invitation to join.⁠
⁠
We are proud of these students for their hard work, dedication, and commitment to academic success! We can&#039;t wait to see what they accomplish next!⁠
⁠
📖 Read the full story: https://www.ncmissouri.edu/phi-theta-kappa-honor-society/⁠
⁠
